  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Loose Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A talc-free, pro-performance loose powder that sets makeup up to 12 hours, blurs, and smooths the complexion with a natural finish and shine control.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Loose Powder</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p>- Light-Diffusing Spherical Powders and Smoothing Amino Acid: Blur lines and pores.</p><p>- Kaolin: Provides all-day shine control.</p><p>- Squalene: Nourishes the skin.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p>Suggested Usage:</p><p>Puff Application:</p><p>-Fold and rub the powder into the Master Pro Puff, then press and roll the product into the skin, smoothing the complexion, for a more concentrated SoftSet look.</p><p>-The tapered corner is perfect for precise application under the eyes and in the small parts of the face.</p><p><br></p><p>Brush Application:</p><p>-Use the F2 Brush to lightly dust powder all over the complexion and the F3 Brush to set the under-eye area for a softer, diffused effect (each sold separately).</p><p><br></p><p>Pro Tips:</p><p>-The formula allows for layering over creams and powders alike, which is integral to Mario’s technique– layer Soft Pop Plumping Blush Veil or Soft Pop Blush Stick (each sold separately) over the powder to add a pop of color to your SoftSet.</p><p>-For a soft, brightening effect, try one of the following shades: 1 – Fair Pink, 3 - Neutral Peach, 4 – Warm Honey, 4.5 – Medium Dark Honey.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Light-Diffusing Spherical Powders and Smoothing Amino Acid: Visibly blur lines and pores.<br>-Kaolin: Provides all-day shine absorption.<br>-Squalane: Nourishes skin.<br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Silica, Lauroyl Lysine, Kaolin, Magnesium Myristate, Zinc Stearate, Dimethicone, Squalane, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Potassium Sorbate, Caprylyl Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol. May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Loose Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A talc-free, pro-performance loose powder that sets makeup up to 12 hours, blurs, and smooths the complexion with a natural finish and shine control.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Loose Powder</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p>- Light-Diffusing Spherical Powders and Smoothing Amino Acid: Blur lines and pores.</p><p>- Kaolin: Provides all-day shine control.</p><p>- Squalene: Nourishes the skin.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p>Suggested Usage:</p><p>Puff Application:</p><p>-Fold and rub the powder into the Master Pro Puff, then press and roll the product into the skin, smoothing the complexion, for a more concentrated SoftSet look.</p><p>-The tapered corner is perfect for precise application under the eyes and in the small parts of the face.</p><p><br></p><p>Brush Application:</p><p>-Use the F2 Brush to lightly dust powder all over the complexion and the F3 Brush to set the under-eye area for a softer, diffused effect (each sold separately).</p><p><br></p><p>Pro Tips:</p><p>-The formula allows for layering over creams and powders alike, which is integral to Mario’s technique– layer Soft Pop Plumping Blush Veil or Soft Pop Blush Stick (each sold separately) over the powder to add a pop of color to your SoftSet.</p><p>-For a soft, brightening effect, try one of the following shades: 1 – Fair Pink, 3 - Neutral Peach, 4 – Warm Honey, 4.5 – Medium Dark Honey.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Light-Diffusing Spherical Powders and Smoothing Amino Acid: Visibly blur lines and pores.<br>-Kaolin: Provides all-day shine absorption.<br>-Squalane: Nourishes skin.<br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Silica, Lauroyl Lysine, Kaolin, Magnesium Myristate, Zinc Stearate, Dimethicone, Squalane, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Potassium Sorbate, Caprylyl Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol. May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742).</div></details>",
